<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian coffee temperature and rain detailed.</title>
<headline>Brazilian coffee temperature and rain detailed.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian coffee region temperatures (centigrade) and rain (millimeters) in the 24 hours to 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>Parana State: Londrina 21.2, Nil, Maringa 22.6, Nil, Umuarama 23.3, Nil, Paranavai 21.8, Nil.</p>
<p>Sao Paulo State: Presidente Prudente 22.9, Nil, Franca 18.8, 0.8 mm, Votuporanga 22.5, 5.2 mm, Catanduva 23.0, Nil, Sao Carlos Not Available, Sao Simao 20.8, Nil.</p>
<p>Minas Gerais State: Pocos de Caldas 17.0, Nil, Guaxupe 18.0, Nil.</p>
</text>
